@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About";
    Layout = "_FreeInvoiceLayout";
}

<main class="my-2">

    <h2 class="text-center text-decoration-underline">About Us</h2>

    <div class="card">

        <div class="card-body">
            <p>
                Welcome to <strong>Free Invoices</strong>, your go-to solution for creating professional invoices quickly, easily, and for free.
            </p>

            <h4>🚀 Our Mission</h4>
            <p>
                At FreeInvoice, we believe that invoicing should be simple, fast, and accessible to everyone—freelancers, small businesses, startups, and entrepreneurs alike.
                Our mission is to eliminate the complexity and cost of traditional invoicing tools by providing a completely free, no-sign-up-required platform that gets the job done in minutes.
            </p>

            <h4>✅ Why Choose FreeInvoice?</h4>
            <p class="my-0">
                We designed FreeInvoice to be user-friendly, efficient, and completely secure. Whether you’re billing your first client or managing multiple projects, our tool helps you create polished, professional PDF invoices that reflect your brand.
            </p>
            <strong> Key Features:</strong>
            <ul>
                <li>No Login or Sign-Up Required: Just visit, fill in your invoice details, and download.</li>
                <li>100% Free to Use: No hidden charges, no subscriptions, no trial periods.</li>
                <li>Customizable Templates: Add your logo, business details, client information, itemized services, taxes, and notes.</li>
                <li>Instant PDF Download: Get a ready-to-send, high-quality invoice in just a few clicks.</li>
                <li>Mobile-Friendly: Create invoices on the go, right from your smartphone.</li>
                <li>Auto Save in Browser (Optional): We use local browser storage (if you allow) to keep your last invoice data temporarily.</li>
            </ul>


            <h4>🔐 Your Data is Yours</h4>
            <p>
                We respect your privacy. FreeInvoice does not store your personal information or invoice data on our servers.
                Everything is handled on your browser, and any local data can be cleared at your discretion.
                We also do not use tracking cookies beyond basic, anonymous analytics to improve site performance.
                <br />
                For more information, please see our
                <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="PrivacyPolicy">Privacy Policy</a>  and
                <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Terms">Terms of Service</a>
            </p>

            <h4>🌍 Who is FreeInvoice For?</h4>
            <ul>
                <li>Freelancers & Contractors</li>
                <li>Small Business Owners</li>
                <li>Consultants & Agencies</li>
                <li>Entrepreneurs & Side-Hustlers</li>
                <li>Anyone who needs a clean, quick, and hassle-free invoice</li>
            </ul>

            <h4>💡 Made with Simplicity in Mind</h4>
            <p>
                We built FreeInvoice because we were frustrated by overcomplicated software, logins, and monthly subscriptions just to generate a simple invoice.
                We wanted something clean, fast, and reliable—and now you have it too.
            </p>


        </div>
    </div>

</main>